# P2 (tone) swept from dark to bright at a medium size, on noise bursts: band limit 2 -> 18 kHz, damping 1.4 -> 14 kHz,
# chorus deeper and faster.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 2
track fx1
input impulse 1 0.5
preset 160 0 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
sweep p2 0 255 0 32
gain 1
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below -6
